+ * reserved firmware regions near the TOP of DRAM (observed ~dram_base+4GB,
+ * e.g. 0x8ffeb0000), which pe_identify_machine maps and probes for a magic.
+ * A smaller DRAM leaves those regions unbacked -> external abort (DFSC 0x10)
