+     * DT the "mtr_N" properties and the backing perf-state region data are absent
+     * (console: "ApplePMGRMTRSensor property mtr_1 missing in devicetree"), so every
+     * one of those methods panics (ApplePMGRMTRSensor.cpp:107/108/142 "perfStateNb /
+     * _perfStateRegionRegisters.nb > 0"). We cannot ret the whole dispatcher (it
